I wanted to show myself right away, but
if a great fairy like me pops up in a village this far out,
people might make a big fuss. So I was waiting for the right moment...

Anyway, {playerName},
if you ever do get your own airship,
no drinking at the helm!

Amaltheia is saying,
"Over thousands of moons, Fleece has overcome all sorts of hardships and grown up splendidly;
they are children to be proud of."

